<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 11.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 84.00/83.00 Aug 84.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Jul 82.50 Aug 83.50/84.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Jul 86.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jan/Mar 88.00 Apr/Jun 91.00 Jul 93.00</p>
<p>Avon Jul 82.00/81.50</p>
<p>Wrexham Jul 84.00/83.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Buckinghamshire Jul 81.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk asa 75.00 Oct/Dec 82.50/82.00/81.00 Jan/Mar 84.00 Apr/Jun 87.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Oct/Dec 81.00 Jan/Mar 84.00 Apr/Jun 87.00</p>
<p>Lincolnshire asa 74.50</p>
<p>Avon asa 76.00/75.50</p>
<p>Tilbury harvest 75.00/74.50</p>
</text>
